{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1758871146\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toy Smash Kaboom!</i> is an indie game that blends <strong>Inventory Management</strong>, <strong>Physical Collisions</strong>, and <strong>Auto-Battler strategy</strong>.<br>Enter a chaotic toy world where you\u2019re the commander - manage your inventory, evolve your toys, and set traps to build your ultimate <strong>Kaboom Legion</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combos and unleash devastating ground attacks, air strikes, and magical powers to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/66b2338100e1c404233e01715f93e583.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/66b2338100e1c404233e01715f93e583.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab089feb23e65783cd22fd7da4aeeeee.avif?t=1758871146\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every toy comes with unique mechanics and can trigger powerful synergies through smart pairing and combining, opening up endless tactical possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn\u2019t just about picking the right toys\u2014it\u2019s about where and how you arrange them! Every slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build\u2019s full potential!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/91e626c045fca03aaeb8b709f4c63af6.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/91e626c045fca03aaeb8b709f4c63af6.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactical system from over 300 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ traps to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ magic and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a83722a54faf6a95f0af79e9d7904156.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a83722a54faf6a95f0af79e9d7904156.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/6e20767586a723ddd9db20c28e3b95fe.avif?t=1758871146\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break away from classic inventory management and auto-battlers\u2014it brings full-contact toy clashes to the tabletop, delivering a one-of-a-kind side-scrolling strategy experience bursting with playful chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it\u2019s not just about stats\u2014brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/d7891f5f1c248c943eb10dad2c91ac0f.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/d7891f5f1c248c943eb10dad2c91ac0f.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7a1fb3961bc2157d4f0870cbd8853c48.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7a1fb3961bc2157d4f0870cbd8853c48.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/27dda68a2e9077b32cda1e362120cfee.avif?t=1758871146\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and distinct battle mechanics, shaping your strategy and playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New heroes are on the way, and you\u2019ll get to uncover the stories behind your toys and enjoy even more DIY fun \u2014 all coming in the full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/2506e7e00f127163fb27273b1115001d.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/2506e7e00f127163fb27273b1115001d.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1758871146\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573070?t=1758871146","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/c595f63e8f21f894322c88e2a4a62a626b7db729/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758871146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/8e89761c3165e63994286595f5fff4b35467560e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758871146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/8e89761c3165e63994286595f5fff4b35467560e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758871146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3743450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD &amp; DEV ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/b4c1828214ba54ddc0e007c4c7daed6e.avif?t=1758871146\" width=700 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ce6bb6492810f0d53677392dde37f874.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1080 height=2573 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1758871146\" data-has-big width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toy Smash Kaboom!</i> is an indie game that blends <strong>Inventory Management</strong>, <strong>Physical Collisions</strong>, and <strong>Auto-Battler strategy</strong>.<br>Enter a chaotic toy world where you\u2019re the commander - manage your inventory, evolve your toys, and set traps to build your ultimate <strong>Kaboom Legion</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combos and unleash devastating ground attacks, air strikes, and magical powers to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/66b2338100e1c404233e01715f93e583.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/66b2338100e1c404233e01715f93e583.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab089feb23e65783cd22fd7da4aeeeee.avif?t=1758871146\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every toy comes with unique mechanics and can trigger powerful synergies through smart pairing and combining, opening up endless tactical possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn\u2019t just about picking the right toys\u2014it\u2019s about where and how you arrange them! Every slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build\u2019s full potential!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/91e626c045fca03aaeb8b709f4c63af6.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/91e626c045fca03aaeb8b709f4c63af6.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactical system from over 300 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ traps to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ magic and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a83722a54faf6a95f0af79e9d7904156.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a83722a54faf6a95f0af79e9d7904156.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/6e20767586a723ddd9db20c28e3b95fe.avif?t=1758871146\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break away from classic inventory management and auto-battlers\u2014it brings full-contact toy clashes to the tabletop, delivering a one-of-a-kind side-scrolling strategy experience bursting with playful chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it\u2019s not just about stats\u2014brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/d7891f5f1c248c943eb10dad2c91ac0f.poster.avif?t=1758871146\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/d7891f5f1c248c943eb10dad2c91ac0f.webm?t=1758871146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl